    "exerciseText": "1.\n根据英文释义写出文中出现的对应单词（或词组）\n______: to make sth. less clear and more difficult to understand, usually deliberately\n______: (of speaking, remarks, etc.) without previous thought or preparation\n2.\n一词多义\nWhich of the following underlined word is closest in meaning to the one in the sentence \"\"Win\" can't\nmean victory when ongoing fighting continues to throw the world economy into chaos.\"? ____\nA. I just wanted to throw myself into his arms and cry.\nB. The problem was suddenly thrown into sharp focus.\nC. The speaker was completely thrown by the interruption.\nD. He threw the ball into the bushes and the dog ran to fetch it.\n3.\n翻译：根据给定中文回译英文\n—— ——\n作为评论家和写作教师，我一直惊叹于动词 这颗语言中的小火球 拥有塑造我们认知世\n界方式的巨大力量。动词主导着沟通。许多语言学家甚至认为，句子不过是在动词基础上搭配其\n他成分构成的延伸。\n_____________________________________________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________________________________________",
