    "exerciseText": "1.\n根据英文释义写出文中出现的对应单词（或词组）\n______: (of opinions, views, etc.) to be different\n______: to write or cut words, your name, etc. onto sth.\n2.\n一词多义\nWhich of the following underlined word is closest in meaning to the one in the sentence \"A mob broke\ninto the prison and killed the brothers before they could be tried.\"? ____\nA. If I don't get into the academy this year, I'll try again next year.\nB. Because of security implications the officers were tried in secret.\nC. He's been trying my patience all morning with his constant questions.\nD. We don't sell newspapers—have you tried the coffee shop on the corner?\n3.\n翻译：根据给定中文回译英文\n摩门教是全球数百万人信奉的宗教。然而，许多不了解该宗教的人，往往凭借模糊的刻板印象与\n流行文化内容来对其下定义。事实上，这是一门神学体系复杂、发展历史特殊的宗教。\n_____________________________________________________________________________________\n_________________________________________________________________",
