    "exerciseText": "1.\n根据英文释义写出文中出现的对应单词\n_________: to feel and show that you are sorry for sth. bad or wrong that you have done\n_________: the feeling of being very sorry for sth. bad that you have done\n2.\n一词多义\nWhich of the following underlined words is closest in meaning to the one in the sentence \"One of the plat-\nform's successful titles, \"Breaking the Ice,\" follows the dai qiu pao arc: a pregnancy, a painful separation,\nand a reunion with a professional hockey player.\"? ____\nA. The ball rose in a high arc and fell behind the boundary line.\nB. The Aleutian chain is a long arc of islands in the North Pacific.\nC. The arc between the two marks on the clock face covers 90 degrees.\nD. Even the minor characters in these films come with their own story arcs.\n3.\n根据给定中文回译英文\n从这个意义上说，微短剧把一种始于流媒体时代的趋势推向了极致：规模、数据和快速迭代取代\n了品味与直觉，成为文化生产的主要驱动力。\n_____________________________________________________________________________________\n__________________________________________________________________________________",
