    "exerciseText": "1.\n根据英文释义写出文中出现的对应单词\n_________: an amount that is greater than is needed or can be used\n_________: always wanting more of sth.; not able to be satisfied\n2.\n一词多义\nWhich of the following underlined words is closest in meaning to the one in the sentence \"Even so, I\nimagine that, for some people, the concept of being autistic as being joyful is a tough one to square, given\nthat the diagnostic criteria for autism spectrum disorder defines it as….\"? ____\nA. The boat is rounded at the front but squared off at the back.\nB. A state-owned bank had to be brought in, in order to square the deal.\nC. They must have squared the mayor before they got their plan underway.\nD. He squared his shoulders and took a deep breath before diving into the pool.\n3.\n根据给定中文回译英文\n特殊兴趣让我觉得自己真正活着，仿佛和某种比自己更宏大的东西连接在一起。那是一种完全沉\n浸其中的心流状态，脑子里没有其他任何念头；就像你整个人都在兴趣里畅游，根本无法把注意\n力移开。\n_____________________________________________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________________________________________",
