    "exerciseText": "1.\n根据英文释义写出文中出现的对应单词或词组\n______: in a way that stops and starts often over a period of time; not regularly\n______: a sudden wish to do or have sth., especially when it is sth. unusual or unnecessary\n2.\n一词多义\nWhich of the following underlined word is closest in meaning to the one in the sentence \"I had wondered\nhow Nolan would handle some of the other archaic aspects of the story, such as its violence and its ritu-\nalism: sacrificial ceremonies with animals gushing blood; the supernatural fury of a monster consuming\nmen who scream in agony as they're eaten…\"? ____\nA. Before he died, he had consumed a large quantity of alcohol.\nB. The electricity industry consumes large amounts of fossil fuels.\nC. Thousands of precious manuscripts were consumed by the blaze.\nD. She was consumed by grief for months after her grandma passed away.\n3.\n翻译：根据给定中文回译英文\n—— ——\n以这种方式讲述 神明的干预被降至最低 这个故事依然是一场激动人心的冒险，充满了\n激情、恐惧、温柔与惊奇，但它却缺乏阅读荷马作品时那种独特的刺激感，即现代人与青铜时代\n人之间那道无法逾越的鸿沟。\n_____________________________________________________________________________________\n_________________________________________________________________________",
