    "exerciseText": "1.\n根据英文释义写出文中出现的对应单词\n_________: always wanting more of sth.; not able to be satisfied\n_________: appropriate to a particular situation\n2.\n一词多义\nWhich of the following underlined words is closest in meaning to the one in the sentence \"Having a\ndifferent sensory perception across one or more sense is a diagnostic feature of autism and can lead to a\nneed to retreat to a less overwhelming environment perhaps sooner than others might.\"? ____\nA. The army was forced to retreat after suffering heavy losses.\nB. The snow has retreated from the mountains as temperatures rise.\nC. The government had retreated from its pledge to reduce class sizes.\nD. Faced with failure, he retreated into silence instead of communicating.\n3.\n根据给定中文回译英文\n他们从特殊兴趣中获得的快乐，有时难以用语言描述。那是一种进入专注状态的感觉，除了正在\n进行的、能够调动他们许多感官并给予他们数小时不间断乐趣和愉悦的事情之外，没有任何东西\n能够打扰他们或影响他们。这是一种纯粹的幸福，也许他们家庭中的其他人无法完全理解。\n_____________________________________________________________________________________\n_____________________________________________________________________________________",
