    "exerciseTranslationPrompt": "他们从特殊兴趣中获得的快乐，有时难以用语言描述。那是一种进入专注状态的感觉，除了正在 进行的、能够调动他们许多感官并给予他们数小时不间断乐趣和愉悦的事情之外，没有任何东西 能够打扰他们或影响他们。这是一种纯粹的幸福，也许他们家庭中的其他人无法完全理解。",
    "answerText": "1.insatiable;pertinent 2.D 3.The joy they get from their special interests is sometimes indescribable.It's being in the zone and nothing bothers them or impacts them except the thing they're doing that engages many of their senses and gives them hours of uninterrupted fun and pleasure.It's pure bliss that maybe no-one else in their family can fully understand.",
