    "answerText": "1.baffle;exponential 2.A 3.In this age,cultural output will feel ever more familiar,as writing,songs,and movies become syntheses of what has already been produced.Marathoners are going to want to produce work,by contrast,that feels personal,that relfects their unique self.They're going to want to ifnd ways to use AI to increase their agency,rather than diminish it.",
