    "exerciseText": "1.\n根据英文释义写出文中出现的对应单词\n_________: to go back into a previous condition or into a worse state after making an improvement\n_________: to study sth. closely and/or discuss it in great detail\n2.\n一词多义\nWhich of the following underlined words is closest in meaning to the one in the sentence \"I know enough\nto know that should that moment ever come, I need to ask for help, because if I'm delusional enough to\nhave drunk for so many years without accepting that I was an alcoholic then I'm delusional enough to\nthink that I can start drinking again without inviting the same problems I had before.\"? ____\nA. My mother invited a few friends that she hadn't seen for 20 years.\nB. Such harsh punishments invited prisoners to respond with defiance.\nC. The ministry had invited tenders for the demolition of the buildings.\nD. Anyone interested in contributing articles is invited to contact the editor.\n3.\n根据给定中文回译英文\n如今回想当初自己盘算着喝半瓶酒的那些念头，我会从生理上感到反胃，仿佛在看血肉恐怖片。\n从前那些念头，蛮横不讲理，毫无逻辑，却强行占据思绪，仿佛一把利刃，在我的大脑上刻下深\n深的痕迹。这些令人不适的画面让我看清：不管是酗酒，还是努力克制少喝酒，本质上都是自我\n伤害。\n_____________________________________________________________________________________\n_____________________________________________________________________________________",
